# Verible lint rules (on top of Verible's defaults).
# One rule per line: +rule enables, -rule disables. Every change needs a reason.

# Lines up to 100 characters (Verible default is 100 too; stated explicitly).
+line-length=length:100
# Our style (docs/spec/05_design_flow.md): constants and parameters are ALL_CAPS,
# not Verible's default CamelCase.
+parameter-name-style=localparam_style_regex:[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*;parameter_style_regex:[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*
